{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "description": "Resumo operacional da API. Use este painel para orientar a leitura dos graficos abaixo.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Como interpretar este dashboard\n- **Request Rate** mostra o volume total que a API esta atendendo agora.\n- **5xx Error Rate** alto indica falha do servico; **4xx** alto costuma apontar uso invalido do endpoint ou contrato ruim.\n- **HTTP P95 Latency** mostra a experiencia da maioria dos usuarios. Se ele sobe junto com throughput, observe logs e traces.\n- **Use Case Throughput** ajuda a separar problema de rota HTTP de problema de regra de negocio.\n- Comece pelos cards, depois abra as series por rota e por caso de uso.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Como Ler Esta Visao",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Requisicoes por segundo na API inteira. Queda brusca pode indicar indisponibilidade; subida com latencia estavel costuma ser trafego normal.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Request Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Percentual de respostas 4xx. Alta persistente costuma significar contrato mal utilizado, validacao ruim ou cliente enviando dado incorreto.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_status_class=\"4xx\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "4xx Error Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Percentual de respostas 5xx. Qualquer valor sustentado aqui merece investigacao imediata em logs e traces.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_status_class=\"5xx\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "5xx Error Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Latencia do percentil 95 das requisicoes HTTP filtradas. Se ela sobe sem aumento de erro, o gargalo costuma ser performance e nao disponibilidade.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HTTP P95 Latency",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Volume por rota. Use para identificar qual endpoint esta puxando o trafego total da API.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Requests by Route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Percentual de erro por rota. Uma rota isolada subindo aqui normalmente aponta regressao localizada e nao incidente global.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum by (http_route) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_status_class=~\"4xx|5xx\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum by (http_route) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Error Ratio by Route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Comparacao entre P50, P95 e P99. Quando o P99 se afasta muito do P95, ha cauda longa e poucas requisicoes muito lentas.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HTTP Latency Quantiles",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Volume de casos de uso por resultado. Success deve dominar; crescimento de error indica falha na regra ou dependencia.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (app_use_case, app_outcome) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app_use_case}} • {{app_outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Use Case Throughput by Outcome",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Latencia de negocio por caso de uso. Se uma operacao esta lenta aqui, o problema tende a estar abaixo da camada HTTP.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, app_use_case) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app_use_case}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Use Case P95 by Operation",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "description": "Logs estruturados dos casos de uso. Use este painel para identificar rapidamente qual rota e qual regra de negocio geraram o evento.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{service_name=\"rocketseat-ddd-api\"} |= \"Use case\" |~ \"$use_case\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Recent Use Case Logs",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "description": "Instrucoes rapidas para abrir traces no Tempo a partir do que este dashboard mostra.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34
      },
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Quando abrir o Tempo\n- Abra traces quando **P95** subir ou quando **5xx Error Rate** sair de zero.\n- No Explore do Tempo, comece com: `{ resource.service.name = \"rocketseat-ddd-api\" }`.\n- Para focar em um caso de uso, procure spans com `name = \"$use_case\"` quando o filtro estiver especifico.\n- Cruze com o painel de logs para achar o mesmo fluxo por `trace_id`.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Trace Playbook",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
